### Health Check
GET http://localhost:9002/health

### Pre-trade Risk Check (Order Validation)
POST http://localhost:9002/check
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account_id": 1001,
  "symbol": "AAPL",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "LIMIT",
  "price": "150.00",
  "quantity": "10"
}

### Reserve Balance (Freeze Funds for Limit Order)
POST http://localhost:9002/reserve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account_id": 1001,
  "symbol": "AAPL",
  "side": "BUY",
  "price": "150.00",
  "quantity": "10"
}

### Get Account Balances
GET http://localhost:9002/balances?account_id=1001

